     A                                  1 75'PS2-3'
     A                                  3  4'THERE ARE 4 OPTIONS AVAILABLE WHEN'
     A                                  3 39'PROCESSING THE BATCH RELEASE FILE'
     A                                  5  1'1)  THE ENTIRE BATCH FILE CAN BE P-
     A                                      ROCESSED BY PLACING AN "X" IN THE'
     A                                  6  5'APPROPRIATE FIELD ON THE PRIOR SCR-
     A                                      EEN.  THE ENTIRE FILE CAN ALSO BE'
     A                                  7  5'PROCESSED FROM THE FIRST SCREEN WI-
     A                                      THOUT REVIEWING THE BATCH FILE FROM-
     A                                       THE'
     A                                  8  5'SECOND SCREEN.'
     A                                  9  1'2)  PROCESS THE BATCH FILE FOR SEL-
     A                                      ECTED REQUIREMENT ORDERS THE REMAIN-
     A                                      DER'
     A                                 10  5'OF THE ENTRIES THAT DO NOT CORRESP-
     A                                      OND TO THE SELECTED ORDERS ENTERED'
     A                                 11  5'WILL REMAIN IN THE BATCH FILE.   T-
     A                                      HE MAXIMUM NUMBER OF REQUIREMENT'
     A                                 12  5'ORDERS THAT CAN BE SELECTED IS TWE-
     A                                      LVE (12).'
     A                                 13  1'3)  PROCESS THE ENTIRE BATCH FILE'
     A                                 13 35'EXCEPT FOR A SELECTED NUMBER OF RE-
     A                                      QUIREMENT'
     A                                 14  5'ORDERS.  THE ENTRIES THAT CORRESPO-
     A                                      ND TO THE SELECTED ORDERS WILL REMA-
     A                                      IN'
     A                                 15  5'IN THE BATCH FILE, THE REMAINDER O-
     A                                      F ENTRIES WILL BE PROCESSED.  THE'
     A                                 15 73'MAXIMUM'
     A                                 16  5'NUMBER OF REQUIREMENT ORDERS THAT'
     A                                 16 39'CAN BE SELECTED IS TWELVE (12).'
     A                                 17  1'4)  IF NO PROCESSING OPTION IS DES-
     A                                      IRED AND YOU WISH TO ONLY REVIEW TH-
     A                                      E BATCH'
     A                                 18  5'FILE THEN PRESS "f3" WHEN YOU ARE'
     A                                 18 39'DONE TO RETURN TO THE FIRST SCREEN-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 19  5'NO PROCESSING WILL BE DONE.'
