     A                                      /PROCESS'
     A                                  1 75'PS2-3'
     A                                  3  3'There are several options availabl-
     A                                      e to process the shipping release b-
     A                                      atch'
     A                                  4  3'file:'
     A                                  6  3'1.  The entire batch file can be p-
     A                                      rocessed by placing an "X" in the'
     A                                  7  7'appropriate field on this screen. -
     A                                       The entire file can also be'
     A                                  8  7'processed from the first screen wi-
     A                                      thout reviewing the batch file from'
     A                                  9  7'the second screen.'
     A                                 11  3'2.  Selected entries from the batc-
     A                                      h file may be processed by placing -
     A                                      an'
     A                                 12  7'"X" next to the requirement order(-
     A                                      s) to be processed.  The remaining'
     A                                 13  7'requirement orders will be retaine-
     A                                      d in the batch file.'
     A                                 15  3'3.  If no processing option is des-
     A                                      ired, and you wish only to review t-
     A                                      he'
     A                                 16  7'batch file, then press "F3" when y-
     A                                      ou are finished to return to the'
     A                                 17  7'first screen.  No processing will -
     A                                      be done.'
     A                                 21  1'PRESS "ENTER" TO RETURN TO PREVIOU-
     A                                      S SCREEN'
